  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Deny and ask",
   "texto": [
    "Denial has two parts that embrace the verb: **ne … pas**. **Je ne suis pas français** (I'm not French). In front of vowel, **ne** loses the e: **Il n'est pas anglais**.",
    "There are two easy ways to ask. Turn the tone up at the end: **Tu es français ?** or start with **Est-ce que**: **Est-ce que tu es français ?**"
   ]
